    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>LR Youtube grid gallery is a plugin you can create an area for youtube videos quickly with management by shortcode.<br />\nFor more features Please contact us at <a href=\"http://www.logicrays.com/contact-us-logicrays-india/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Logicrays</a><br />\nIf you like this plugin Please rate us 🙂</p>\n<h3>Plugin Features</h3>\n<p>All modren browser support<br />\nworks with anytype of theme<br />\nEasy to customize for developeres<br />\nEasy to configure</p>\n<h3>Shortcode</h3>\n<pre><code>[lryg-youtube-grid-gallery order=\"DESC\" orderby=\"date\" posts=\"-1\" category=\"all\"]\n</code></pre>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload Zip file lr-youtube-grid-gallery to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"a%20question%20that%20someone%20might%20have\">\nA question that someone might have\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>An answer to that question.</p>\n</p>\n\n"
    },
